{"parse": {"title": "雏鸟为何坠落-08", "pageid": 141891, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%9B%8F%E9%B8%9F%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E5%9D%A0%E8%90%BD-07\" title=\"雏鸟为何坠落-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">雏鸟为何坠落-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">雏鸟为何坠落</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AE.87.E5.AE.99.E9.A3.9E.E8.A1.8C.E5.91.98\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"宇宙飞行员\">宇宙飞行员</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 宇宙飞行员</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Cosmonaut</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_20\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_20\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>呼，可算是搬完了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奠基石合上车后盖，年轻的监工走到她身旁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>这一切还是太过离奇——用曾经见过的一出木偶戏桥段，成功治疗了陌生人的心疾？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我有一个猜想……应该说，建筑师的“奇思妙想”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……希望不会比空中巴别塔更离奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>酷似卢齐安父亲的老人，正好也是一位失去孩子的父亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这个孩子恰好与回声谣……的木偶版长得很像，去世原因也与木偶戏的结局相似。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>回声谣在取回自己记忆的过程中，也解开了老人的心结。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这是否是“记忆之所”冥冥之中的指引……或是“暴雨”无意的安排呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>“暴雨”并不会——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>哈哈，所以我说——只是猜想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我们的朋友还没有完成告别吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>我不想离开！但是……如果回声谣想出去看看的话……老大可不能丢下她！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我……还是不确定是否要离开大家……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奥尔加拍了拍她的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649102.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649102.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>孩子，听从你的心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649102.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649102.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>诺瓦米奇变好了，可外面的世界也有许多有趣的事物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649102.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649102.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>你已经为我们做了许多。我们也希望你出去看看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>可我还是不记得很多事……穹顶坍塌，你们说的牺牲……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649102.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649102.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>别担心，你会想起来的。或许，只是需要一些沟通、一些时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649102.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649102.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>你随时可以回来，我们都还在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649102.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649102.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-649102.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649102.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥尔加：</div><div>房子还在，“鬼魂”还在，我们还可以一起聊聊过去的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>虽然你是个迟钝的“鬼魂”，可总有惊人之举。我相信，外面的世界会给你带来惊喜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>戒烟失败的男人递过来一堆草稿纸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>在外面多宣传我的诗歌，回来也告诉我们些新鲜事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>亚肖……你不出去看看吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>哦，我还是不走了。现在，我也算有了一份稳定的工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-649202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚肖：</div><div>而且，这里也算是我的家乡——诗人永恒的灵感源泉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声谣转过身，看见祖赞娜远远地向她走过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那天之后，祖赞娜请了长假。她们已有十天没见了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>嗨，回声谣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>嗨，祖赞娜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>你把石头还回去了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>嗯，负责人说，基金会会统一保护那处回声石遗址。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>我刚从医院回来。舅舅去世了，我把他葬在了家乡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>哦……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>没关系，我是想来谢谢你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>虽然我们仍不知道表姐当时的情况……但你善意的谎言，已经弥补了舅舅的遗憾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>他……不再伤心了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>祖赞娜笑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>我想是的。他最后的日子都是笑着的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>而且，虽然很奇怪……但是看到你平安跃下，我的心中也生出一丝莫名的慰藉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她眼神失焦，望着这座灰蒙蒙的城市。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>就像是完成了一件心头大事……可我对这里几乎没有记忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>诺瓦米奇究竟为何在梦中呼唤我？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>你还会走吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>哦，我想我还会待几个月……仔细看看春天的诺瓦米奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>虽然它变了太多，可能已经不再是之前那座城市了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-654001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>不过，我想，最后我还是会走的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我会记得你来过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>祖赞娜笑着摆摆手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-654012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>你说得像我快死了！我还会活很久咧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我也要走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"654011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"654011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-654011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-654011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">祖赞娜：</div><div>是吗……那……后会有期。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>走了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师呼唤着少女，为她打开了车门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>……再见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她挥挥手，与蓝图一起上了汽车。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-chenei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"chenei\"><img alt=\"chenei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/600px-Cg-chenei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/900px-Cg-chenei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/1200px-Cg-chenei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>汽车行到了街道的拐角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>        <br />            <b><span style=\"font-size:194%\">那……后会有期。</span></b></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>陈旧的记忆从光之海中浮现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>你是……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_19.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_19\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_19\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-3_8_bg_19.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_19.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-3_8_bg_19.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_19.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-3_8_bg_19.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声谣猛然将头伸出车窗，回望站在建筑门口挥别的人们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-314520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-314520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-314520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>你是——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>你是谁？她找不到一个名字，她从来不知道木偶师的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>名字，与你相关的名字……你介绍过的名字、手偶的名字、木偶戏主角的名字……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-314520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-314520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-314520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>你是小洪扎！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"649312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"649312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-649312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-649312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小洪扎：</div><div>回声谣，我在这儿！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_20\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_20\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们的身影在尘土中渐渐远去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-314519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我知道你们为何在此了……或许你们都心存遗憾……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650218.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-650218.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650218.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650218.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-650218.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650218.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-650218.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650218.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>回来！这是危险行为！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-chenei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"chenei\"><img alt=\"chenei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/600px-Cg-chenei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/900px-Cg-chenei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/1200px-Cg-chenei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓝图将脱线的女孩拉回座椅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……呼，我总是不擅长应对你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-650202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>如果你不想和那些恐怖电影里的木偶一样掉脑袋，那就千万不要再这么做了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>哈哈，我们的朋友还有许多需要学习的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>潇洒的司机随手扭开了车载电台。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台：</div><div>市政厅已通过了最新法案，该法案规定……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回声谣想起了一个电台频道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>FM92.4……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你说什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>可以把频道调整到FM92.4吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>唔……当然可以？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵嘈杂的电流声过后，她听到了电台播放的内容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台：</div><div>各位听众，下午好。接下来，敬请收听《宇宙飞行员》大结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>喔，似乎是一本有声书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台：</div><div>此时此地一片寂静，我的故乡已空无一人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台：</div><div>我又该去往何处？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台：</div><div>我该永远留在寂静的春天，或是前往未知的宇宙？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回忆的细线被牵动、提起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我是宇宙飞行员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台：</div><div>我将带着你们的记忆离去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>我将记住你们所有的欢笑和回忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>朋友们啊，我们终将重逢。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>遥远的歌声渐渐消弭，电台以片尾曲对观众作出告别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台&amp;回声谣：</div><div>我歌唱着，歌唱着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台&amp;回声谣：</div><div>直到远方的光里传来回声——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314525.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-314525.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314525.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314525.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-314525.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314525.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-314525.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314525.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">回声谣：</div><div>你猜对了，正巧是我。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "雏鸟为何坠落-08"}}